#: crypto.cpp:808
msgid ""
"This list box shows which sites you have decided to accept a certificate "
"from even though the certificate might fail the validation procedure."
msgstr ""
"यो सूची बाकसले तपाईँले यसबाट प्रमाणपत्र स्वीकार गर्नका लागि कुन साइट निश्चय गर्नुभयो "
"देखाउँछ ता पनि प्रमाणपत्र वैधता विधि असफल हुन सक्छ ।"

#: crypto.cpp:816
msgid "&Add"
msgstr "थप्नुहोस्"

#: crypto.cpp:829
msgid ""
"These options are not configurable because this module was not linked with "
"OpenSSL."
